# hermes-knowledge-base — Taste Rules

**Primary reference**: linear.app
**Secondary reference**: vercel.com
**Source audit**: `outputs/taste-1b-hermes-kb/HERMES_KB_DESIGN_AUDIT.md`
**In-repo rationale**: `../DESIGN_RATIONALE.md`
**Agent rules**: `../CLAUDE.md`

---

## Identity

The knowledge base is a **tool that hosts content**, not a marketing page that sells it.
Interface should disappear when user is reading. Light theme only — dark theme is wrong for
varied lighting conditions.

## Color tokens

Always use these CSS variables; never hardcode hex outside `:root` in `styles.css`:

```
--color-bg: #FAFAFA
--color-surface: #FFFFFF
--color-text-primary: #1A1A1A
--color-text-secondary: #555555
--color-text-meta: #6B7280
--color-border: #E5E7EB
--color-accent: #2563EB
--color-on-accent: #FFFFFF
--color-accent-bg: #EFF6FF
--color-tag-bg: #F3F4F6
--color-tag-text: #374151
--color-category-a: #EFF6FF (blue, informational)
--color-category-b: #FEF3C7 (amber, caution)
--color-category-c: #D1FAE5 (emerald, safe)
--color-category-d: #F3E8FF (purple, exploratory)
```

## Accent rationing (single most important rule)

`#2563EB` / `var(--color-accent)` may appear ONLY on:
- `<a>` links
- `<button>` primary and `[role="button"]`
- `:focus-visible` outlines
- Exactly one active filter pill at a time

Never on: section headers, dividers, category labels, card decorations, banner backgrounds,
stat-card numbers, type badges.

Before any merge, run `grep -rE '#2563EB|var\(--color-accent\)' site/styles.css docs/styles.css`
and verify the count hasn't grown compared to baseline.

## Typography

- Font family: `-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', system-ui, sans-serif`
- 2 weights only: `400` and `600`
- No web fonts. No Inter. No Geist. No IBM Plex. No JetBrains Mono.
- Scale (rem-based):
  - H1 (page title): 1.6rem / 600 / line-height 1.6
  - Body: 0.95rem / 400 / line-height 1.6
  - Meta: 0.75rem / 400 / line-height 1.5
- No negative letter-spacing anywhere.
- Single H1 per page; no H2–H6 outside `.markdown-body`.

## Spacing scale (only these values)

```
--space-1: 4px
--space-2: 8px (base)
--space-3: 12px
--space-4: 16px
--space-5: 24px
--space-6: 32px
--space-7: 40px
--space-8: 64px
--space-9: 96px (max section gap)
```

No `13px`, no `105px`, no other values. Use the closest scale value.

## Cards

- Width: 720px on 1440px container (49% container-width)
- Padding: 18px horizontal / 16px vertical
- Gap between cards: 16px
- Border: 1px solid `var(--color-border)`
- Category signal: pastel badge (`var(--color-category-*)`) — not a stripe, since the current
  type-badge pattern already encodes category visually
- Shadow: `box-shadow: var(--shadow-card)` (border-style, NOT blur)
- Radius: `var(--radius-card)` = 8px
- Title: 1.05rem / 600
- Description: 0.85rem / secondary text
- Tags: 0.75rem / meta color
- Metadata row: 0.8rem / secondary text / inline separator
- Hover: change border to `var(--color-text-secondary)`, NO shadow change, NO lift, NO scale

## Radius tokens

```
--radius-button: 6px
--radius-card: 8px
--radius-pill: 12px
--radius-banner: 20px
```

## Filter pills

- Default: `var(--color-surface)` background, secondary text
- Hover: border becomes accent, text becomes accent, **background stays surface** (no full flip)
- Active: accent background, `var(--color-on-accent)` text (exactly one at a time)
- Counter format: `Category (24)` in meta color, no bold
- Never use category pastels as pill backgrounds — pastels are for type badges only
- Radius: `var(--radius-pill)` = 12px

## Search box

- 720px wide, ~39px tall
- Radius: 8px (`var(--radius-card)`)
- Single bottom border is OK; current full border is fine
- No inner icon

## Empty state

When filter returns zero cards:
- Center-aligned, body text in `--color-text-secondary`
- No illustration, no CTA, no emoji, no exclamation mark
- Never write "Oops!" or "Try adjusting your search!"

## Mobile (below 768px)

- Cards: full-width, no 720px constraint
- Below 480px: filter tabs collapse to horizontal scroll row (not dropdown, not hamburger)
- Touch targets: min 44×44px
- Font sizes stay the same (system font scales with OS preference)

## Container

- Max-width: 1440px (was 1408px — aligned to Vercel reference)

## Anti-patterns (always forbidden)

- Gradients anywhere except existing banner element
- Multi-layer shadows
- `filter: drop-shadow(...)`
- Glow effects
- Hover animations (scale, translate, opacity)
- Decorative icons in empty states / headers / category labels
- SaaS-hero layout (big headline + subhead + CTA)
- Generic empty-state copy ("Oops!", "Try a different search!")
- Vague adjectives without measurements ("clean", "modern", "seamless")
- Exclamation marks in user-facing strings
- Hardcoded hex values outside `:root` in `styles.css`
- Inline styles for color / spacing / radius
- New web fonts added to the repo
- Negative letter-spacing
- H2–H6 elements (single H1 per page only)

## Documentation requirements

When adding a new component or pattern, document it with the **Trigger → Decision → Reason →
Evidence** structure (4 principles: Readability / System Font / Pastel Categories / Structural
Flatness).

## When in doubt

Read `outputs/taste-1b-hermes-kb/HERMES_KB_DESIGN_AUDIT.md` and `DESIGN_RATIONALE.md`. If a change
doesn't fit any of the 4 documented principles, propose it as a separate design review — not a
silent code change.
